{"ticker":"BBAI","updated":"2026-10-23T22:40:40Z","profile":{"longName":"BigBear.ai Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"BigBear.ai, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://bigbear.ai","fullTimeEmployees":579,"marketCap":1026118272,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-10.700001,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.795652,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":4.0,"targetHighPrice":4.0,"targetLowPrice":4.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":2,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":0.132,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.27919,"operatingMargins":-0.74447995,"profitMargins":-0.65199995,"totalRevenue":131627000,"beta":3.262,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":7.4,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":2.07,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"BigBear.ai Holdings, Inc. provides artificial intelligence-powered decision intelligence solutions for national security, supply chain management, and digital identity markets. It offers supply chain and logistics solutions, such as Data Conflation at Scale, which offers a view of operations enabling real-time tracking of inventory and facilitating predictive analytics to optimize functions, including routes and delivery times; Discrete Event Simulation, a course of action analysis and digital twin solution; and Next-Gen Decision Support solution for macroeconomic and geopolitical forecasting. The company also provides cybersecurity solutions, such as artificial intelligence (AI)-powered/machine-accelerated binary analysis, cyber-physical systems vulnerability testing and evaluation, vulnerability assessment as a service, and specialized services for the department of defense and intelligence community; and autonomous systems solutions, AI/machine learning (ML) decision intelligence solutions, and AI orchestration as a service, as well as specialized consulting services. In addition, it offers digital identity services comprising security solutions specializing in customized digital identity, biometrics, AI/ML, and advanced analytics software and solutions for global trade, travel, and digital identity industries; and Ask Sage Platform, a generative AI platform for secure AI de","summary_zh":"BigBear.ai Holdings, Inc. 為國家安全、供應鏈管理和數位身分市場提供人工智慧驅動的決策智慧解決方案。它提供供應鏈和物流解決方案，例如大規模數據合併，它提供了營運視圖，能夠即時追蹤庫存並促進預測分析以優化功能，包括路線和交貨時間；離散事件模擬，行動分析過程和數位孿生解決方案；用於宏觀經濟和地緣政治預測的下一代決策支援解決方案。該公司還提供網路安全解決方案，例如人工智慧（AI）驅動/機器加速的二元分析、網路物理系統漏洞測試和評估、漏洞評估即服務以及為國防部和情報界提供的專業服務；和自主系統解決方案、人工智慧/機器學習 (ML) 決策智慧解決方案、人工智慧編排即服務以及專業諮詢服務。此外，它還提供數位身分服務，包括專門從事客製化數位身分、生物辨識、人工智慧/機器學習的安全解決方案，以及針對全球貿易、旅遊和數位身分產業的高級分析軟體和解決方案； Ask Sage Platform，一個用於安全 AI 開發的生成式 AI 平台","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":5.48,"h":5.5,"l":5.28,"c":5.3,"v":51819600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":5.3,"h":5.48,"l":5.19,"c":5.35,"v":53043000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":5.35,"h":5.39,"l":5.11,"c":5.13,"v":44619400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":5.2,"h":5.25,"l":5.1,"c":5.16,"v":43131100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":5.15,"h":5.18,"l":4.95,"c":5.07,"v":38137200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":4.95,"h":5.08,"l":4.81,"c":5.02,"v":43589300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":5.005,"h":5.03,"l":4.85,"c":4.9,"v":30724800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":4.91,"h":4.98,"l":4.75,"c":4.93,"v":40958500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":5.0,"h":5.06,"l":4.73,"c":4.98,"v":45189800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":4.99,"h":5.05,"l":4.85,"c":4.87,"v":33041600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":4.88,"h":4.9,"l":4.73,"c":4.8,"v":37191300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":4.87,"h":4.92,"l":4.65,"c":4.73,"v":49356000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":4.73,"h":5.09,"l":4.695,"c":4.87,"v":61593000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":5.19,"h":5.38,"l":4.97,"c":5.06,"v":118700900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":5.18,"h":5.33,"l":5.02,"c":5.09,"v":92017700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":5.34,"h":6.0,"l":5.33,"c":5.94,"v":213075000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":5.81,"h":6.17,"l":5.61,"c":6.02,"v":148128300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":6.24,"h":6.43,"l":6.02,"c":6.28,"v":121507900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":6.31,"h":6.94,"l":6.275,"c":6.85,"v":156953000}